WEBVTT

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.060
Thank you.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.990
Hey, wait a... What's this for?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.700
Here.

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:12.430
Hey, answer me!

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.340
Nagira.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:19.950
Eat that.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:26.990
What're you...

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:36.660
She isn't leaving, is she?

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:45.800
Nagira... Thank you for everything.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:09.520
I feel like it'll disappear...

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:15.250
...the instant I look away.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:20.390
I just kept counting...

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:25.830
...all the many traces of loneliness...

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:33.200
...that I'd vomited up.

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:39.140
In this time that seems so dry,

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:44.250
...my heart is thrashing around and drowning.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:50.110
It takes those lies that make my head spin...

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:53.160
...and tears them to pieces.

00:01:52.990 --> 00:02:02.830
 And the place I lose my way in...

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:10.660
...is a dim, hazy world.

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:48.560
Chief, these are the three guys, right?

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.690
What do you think? Can you get them registered right away?

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:57.340
Sure, that's not a problem, but do we really need police protection?

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.670
What are you saying?

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.610
Have you forgotten that a police prisoner van was attacked?

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.250
We can't even say for certain that we're safe here.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.610
And I'm not about to put up with the security system going off all the time!

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.180
Hurry up and register them!

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:10.780
Okay.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:15.290
Sir, about Mr. Toudou's ROM...

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:19.620
It's clear that 80% of the files were decoded 15 years ago.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.790
What about the other 20%?

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:25.500
Their contents seem to have been decoded,

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.900
...but since they weren't directly connected to genetics research,

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.840
...they seem to have been deleted from the report.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:32.870
And the files?

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.700
They were deleted to prevent them from being leaked,

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:39.110
...but I expect to have them decoded again by the end of the day.

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:43.920
Forward the results to me as they come in. I don't care if it's just fragments.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:45.880
Understood, sir.

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:09.140
Looks like it's all quiet again today.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.550
What's up? Thinking isn't really your style.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:19.960
What that guy said yesterday, "The Devil's child"...

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.890
Do you think that was directed at Robin?

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.660
Beats me.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.260
Don't try to lie to me.

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:28.250
The power that Robin has now isn't normal, no two ways about it!

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:32.560
And that guy yesterday was a Solomon scientist, right?

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.730
If it's bothering you that much, ask Robin about it to her face.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.630
Yeah, like I could do that.

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.840
She already looked like she was about to start crying.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:50.380
Hello?

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:54.580
Yes.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:06.460
"The Devil's child"...
He said that when he saw my face.

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:12.440
I...

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:18.480
The organization started hunting me because I learned the arcana of the Craft.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:23.280
But I sensed something else in the letter Juliano wrote.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.610
Maria, a woman who looked like me...

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:29.880
Toudou's research...

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:35.590
"The Devil's child"...
He meant me.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:42.430
I'm... something that should never have been born.

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:08.920
Robin, you have a visitor.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.230
I do? Who is it?

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:15.000
All he'd say is that he came from Italy.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:19.370
He wants to see you alone. What do you want to do?

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:22.740
I'll see him.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:37.490
Juliano.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:45.590
Juliano...!

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:53.300
Forgive me, Father, for I have sinned.

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:57.680
We all sin, my child.

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:01.950
No, this is different. Please, tell me the truth.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.850
Tell me the truth behind the profound sin I've been made to carry.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.850
You're saying that you will accept it all?

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:14.160
Far better for the truth to tear my flesh apart...

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:18.030
...than my soul to wander in darkness for eternity.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.840
Very well.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:24.470
O Lord, grant me strength.

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:26.800
Grant me the courage to accept the truth, whatever it may be.

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:36.680
Juliano, am I a manufactured Witch?

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:42.790
That's right. You are a designer Witch created through genetic manipulation.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:49.450
The fragrance of the fruit of the Tree of Knowledge leads man to forbidden desires.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:52.730
When Solomon abandoned their genetic research,

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:57.800
...Toudou, one of their science team, refused to abide by their decision,

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:02.000
...and, manipulating genetic material from a certain Witch, created you on his own.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:04.670
A certain Witch? Created me?

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.200
Maria...!

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.710
So, I was right. I'm that woman's...

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:13.520
Juliano, you're Maria's...

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:16.580
Maria...

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:22.730
Maria... is my daughter.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:28.770
So that means that you're...

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.700
What're you two doing?

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.680
Acting as Robin's lookouts.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:39.680
Was there some activity?

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.520
I got word from HQ a few minutes ago.

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:45.480
Solomon's sending out an assault team.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:48.850
An assault team? To the Factory?

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:53.490
Right. If we don't act soon, we'll lose our chance to rescue Miho.

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:54.760
When?

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.300
Just before dawn tomorrow.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.770
That's not much time.

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:00.860
What do we do? It's not like we can force our way in.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.830
No, that might actually be the right way to go.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:09.700
You are not the only one who has borne this sin.

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:11.580
How long have you...

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.140
Since the day you were born.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:19.620
So, this whole time, you've...

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:25.660
Why didn't you hunt me? I should never have been born.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:29.100
If you had hunted me before I had learned anything,

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.630
...I wouldn't have had to suffer like this.

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:38.540
Yes, I should have killed you as soon as I learned you had been born.

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:42.430
No, on that day, I went to Maria fully intending to do so.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:45.110
But I was unable to do it.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:46.480
You couldn't?

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:51.390
Maria was a Witch.

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:57.560
For me, a member of Solomon, that fact was difficult to accept.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:00.700
But when I learned that Maria's days on this earth were numbered...

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.320
...due to a genetic abnormality she was born with,

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:07.870
...I didn't want to lose my daughter. I didn't want to lose Maria.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:11.870
When I heard that she was having a baby with Toudou,

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:14.070
...I was simply overjoyed.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.670
I believed that God was still smiling upon me.

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.940
But Toudou had deceived me.

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:25.620
Maria was nothing more than a test subject to him.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:31.050
And then, on that day, I stood over you.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:38.170
But when I saw you, whom Maria had given her life to give birth to,

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:42.230
...all I could do was walk back, carrying you in my arms.

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:47.870
You didn't necessarily possess the power that Toudou had designed into you.

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:50.980
Or so I told myself.

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:57.220
Perhaps all I have been doing is putting off the day when I must learn that answer.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:01.460
I was relieved that your innate powers had not appeared,

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:05.980
...and prayed in my heart that you would stay this way forever.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:12.530
But I learned the arcana of the Craft and became a source of anguish to you, Juliano.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:17.400
No, not at all. It was the weakness of my heart.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:24.140
When you left my side, my heart was assailed by intense anxiety.

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:26.650
Misgivings? Yes, that's it.

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:29.010
Misgivings that you would awaken one day.

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:34.910
That you yourself would change. No, that I was already being deceived.

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:38.990
At some point, these misgivings turned to fear, urging me to order your hunt.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:52.830
What made me suffer was my own weakness, nothing more.

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:56.740
I didn't want to change.

00:11:58.010 --> 00:11:59.670
You have not changed.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:05.010
Excessive power leads man to a downward spiral of corruption.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.120
It terrified me.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:10.320
The thought of you, addicted to your own power, terrified me.

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:14.920
But it would seem that my anxiety was unfounded.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:19.100
Robin, what I must ask you now is,

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:23.230
...having confronted the truth, to what penance do you sentence yourself?

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:27.940
I would sooner take my own life than go on living as someone else's original sin.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.550
I have faith in you.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:35.140
No matter how cruel the truth may be, I know you will be able to meet it head-on.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:39.080
You have that strength within you.

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.990
This is part of Toudou's secret journal.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.720
Not even I know the whole truth.

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:55.660
But if you read it, I think you will know where the answers are hidden.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:56.970
Robin...

00:12:57.610 --> 00:13:02.380
Maria... My daughter called you "hope."

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.140
Hope? Me?

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.280
Why? What about me would make her say that?

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.290
I do not have that answer, either.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:22.620
But seeing you here, unchanged, I believe I understand what she may have meant.

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:28.760
What you do with that truth, I leave in your hands.

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:38.510
Robin, please forgive this old fool.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:47.150
O Lord, bestow Thy blessings upon this child.

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:14.470
Project Robin...?

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:20.850
Robin?

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:43.870
He got away!

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:48.040
Amon!

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:50.280
Inside! One got away!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.360
And that's one down...

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:06.530
Brother!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.700
Your follow-through always was a little weak.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.870
Mind if I join your little gang?

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.150
Nagira? But why?

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.450
I guess I can't stand by and watch.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.550
Oh, that reminds me, Robin.

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:29.890
We don't really have a tradition here where you eat noodles to say goodbye, Robin.

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:31.530
What's he talking about?

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.460
Oh. Uh...

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:36.300
You're pressed for time, right? Let's hurry.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.160
Right.

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:41.260
The file decoding is behind schedule?

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:47.540
Yes, sir. Some of the files have particularly heavy encryption.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.380
I believe I may be able to have it done by tomorrow night.

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:50.610
That's too late!

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:54.440
Put more personnel on it if you have to, but put a rush on that decoding!

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:57.140
Yes, sir. I understand.

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:05.080
So, a ghost from 15 years ago?

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.980
Now conducting security check. Please open your face guards.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.820
Now conducting security check. Please open your face guards.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:44.800
Pupil scan confirmed.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:50.640
ID 1ZY16SP1718.

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:48.940
That's a few years off my life...

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.240
I know what you mean.

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:53.170
Please proceed to Gate 2.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:53.170
I wonder if Amon and the others will be okay?

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:54.330
I'm sure they'll be fine.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:56.270
If they screw up, we're on our own.

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:04.480
I made you some tea, Chief.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.180
Thanks.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.720
Yes, sir. I understand. I'll be right there.

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:15.330
Where are you going, Chief?

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:16.700
The National Police Agency.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:17.460
Then...

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:18.520
Right.

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:25.600
Mind the fort, Hattori.

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:28.770
Yes, sir. Be careful.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.990
Sakaki! It's Amon and the others!

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:51.420
Way to go!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.470
Think it's them?

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:54.640
Yeah.

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.760
Let's move out.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.210
Sorry we took so long.

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:05.840
It's like it doesn't matter whether or not we changed into these things.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:08.420
Hey, I haven't seen a single person since we got here.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:09.610
Are you sure this is the place?

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:14.480
Looks like the real base is deep underground, not up here on this floor.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:15.720
Underground?

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.660
How do we go down?

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.090
There's just an elevator.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:23.420
And from what I can see here, there's just the one.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.110
It's here!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.570
If you want to back out, now's the time. What do you want to do?

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:46.490
Gee, whatever shall I do?

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:47.510
Let's get moving.

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:50.890
In that case, here goes nothing.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.530
We're sure going down a long way.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:17.610
Security's looser than I expected...

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:21.290
But if anything does happen, there's only one exit.

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:23.810
So the way out is easy, but coming back is a bitch, huh?

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:26.690
Maybe Karasuma's someplace else...

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:29.660
Damn it, this is confusing!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.970
Look, don't you think it's safe to take these masks off?

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:33.290
I suppose you're right.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.560
Guys, look at this!

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:38.210
What's the matter?

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.260
There's a door that's not accepting my access code.

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:45.000
Give me a minute. I'll trying looking it up using a different code.

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:48.110
Got it.

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:04.830
It didn't occur to me earlier, but according to the data I confirmed upstairs,

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:06.200
...this place doesn't exist.

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:08.740
In other words, bingo.

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:20.040
What is this place?

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:23.220
"Plant" was written by the entrance.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:24.310
Plant?

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.690
At any rate, it looks like this is the Orbo production plant.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:33.190
Hey, even if we search the place top to bottom, is Karasuma gonna be here?

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:56.810
Let's go.

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:58.010
Where?

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:00.010
Up there.

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:06.890
If she isn't here, either, then...

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:10.020
This is weird. There's no sign of a Witch detention center.

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:12.960
So what the hell is it that they do here?

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:14.660
I have no idea.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:25.510
Hey, haven't I told you not to touch...

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:35.040
Darn it, Robin, what did you...

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:42.230
A person...

00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:50.430
These are the Witches we hunted...

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:53.000
Then the Orbo back there was...

00:21:57.680 --> 00:22:01.440
Hey, wait a minute! That means that this place is...

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:07.320
This is what was really behind our "humane" hunts?

00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:11.520
All this time, we've been helping them do this?!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:14.690
Karasuma...

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:18.150
Karasuma is in one of these.

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:26.970
This can't be happening...

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:44.830
Just how far back do I need to go?

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:47.690
Tell me.

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:59.680
It's all so vivid that it hurts.

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:09.570
The truth is, nothing can be shared,

00:23:09.250 --> 00:23:14.060
...so I never looked back.

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:19.430
...all those promises...

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:25.830
...inside me eventually...

00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:31.630
...gave up on that light from some other time,

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:40.410
...like the light of a morning you can't return to.
